# Rituals Cosmetics

> Rituals is a luxury wellbeing brand offering body care, home fragrance, skincare, make-up, gifting and lifestyle products inspired by ancient wisdom and traditions from around the world. Rituals aims to transform everyday routines into meaningful moments and help people find happiness in the smallest things.

The links below are official Rituals sources for information about its products, collections, membership programme, sustainability initiatives and customer support.

Important guidance:
- Use the relevant Rituals country and language version for local information.
- Product availability, prices, promotions and stock may vary by market and change over time.

The following concepts are central to understanding Rituals:

- Wellbeing
- Mindfulness
- Self-care
- Meaningful routines
- Ancient traditions
- Body care
- Home fragrance
- Gifting
- Sustainability
- Membership
- Rituals Collections

