## Product Categories

- [Body](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/body): Body, bath and shower care, including body care, hands and feet and related products.
- [Home](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/home-collection): Home fragrance and lifestyle products, including fragrance sticks, scented candles and home perfumes.
- [Beauty](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/beauty): Skincare, make-up and other beauty products and routines.
- [Gifts](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/gifts): Gift sets, gift inspiration and gifting occasions.
- [Men](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/men): Body, grooming, skincare and lifestyle products for men.

## Collections

- [The Ritual of Sakura](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/sakura): Inspired by the Japanese Hanami tradition; features cherry blossom and rice milk.
- [The Ritual of Ayurveda](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/ayurveda): Inspired by Ayurvedic traditions and balance between body, mind and soul.
- [The Ritual of Jing](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/jing): Products focused on tranquillity, relaxation, sleep and inner calm.
- [The Ritual of Karma](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/karma): Inspired by positive energy and summer wellbeing; features lotus flower and white tea.
- [The Ritual of Hammam](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/hammam): Inspired by traditional cleansing rituals and refreshing body care experiences.
- [Rituals Homme](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/homme): Body care, grooming and skincare products designed for men.
- [Rituals Skincare](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/skincare): Facial skincare collection and routines focused on healthy-looking skin.
- [Make-up](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/make-up-looks): Rituals make-up collection and make-up looks.
- [Amsterdam Collection](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/amsterdam): Collection inspired by Amsterdam and created in celebration of Rituals' partnership with the Rijksmuseum.
- [Private Collection](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/private): Premium home fragrance collection including candles, fragrance sticks and home perfumes.
- [Rituals Sport](https://www.rituals.com/en-nl/collection/sport): Products designed for active lifestyles and post-exercise routines.

